    "name":  "LED Filament Pendant Lamp - Smoked Glass - 4W - Amber",
    "reference":  "DL4WSM-GW-91190",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eDiscover the perfect fusion of elegance and efficiency with our \u003cstrong\u003eSmoked Glass LED Pendant Lamp\u003c/strong\u003e, specially designed to accentuate your decor. With its attractive conical shape and modern design, it effortlessly integrates into any interior decorating style, suspended from the ceiling.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis lamp not only provides \u003cstrong\u003ewarm and inviting light\u003c/strong\u003e but also adds a touch of sophistication with its carefully crafted glass design. Illuminate with elegance and environmental consciousness to create a captivating ambiance!\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eLED Filament Pendant Lamp - Smoked Glass - 4W - Amber\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIlluminate with distinction and efficiency thanks to our \u003cstrong\u003eLED Filament Pendant Lamp\u003c/strong\u003e! Specially designed to enhance your décor, this luminaire perfectly combines style and functionality. Its attractive conical shape and modern design make it an elegant addition to any interior décor, suspended gracefully from the ceiling.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt stands out with its \u003cstrong\u003eSmoked Crystal\u003c/strong\u003e casing, which blends harmoniously with various decorative styles. This lamp not only provides warm and cosy illumination, but also adds a touch of sophistication with its neat filament design. Transform your spaces into unique and stylish environments.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe versatility of this LED lamp makes it suitable for a variety of applications:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- General Lighting:\u003c/strong\u003e Perfect for homes, offices and commercial establishments, providing a cosy ambient light.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Decorative Lighting:\u003c/strong\u003e Highlights common areas of the home, highlighting hallways and staircases, or provides work light in office spaces.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Special Environments:\u003c/strong\u003e Ideal for illuminating reading areas, shops and exhibitions in showrooms, creating unique atmospheres.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTurn every corner into a stylish space with this LED Filament Pendant Lamp, a fusion of elegance and efficiency that complements your décor in an exceptional way. Opt for the quality of lighting that will transform your spaces!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn FactorLED we ensure that our products have QUALITY guarantee and offer all the necessary elements for DISTRIBUTION, IMPORT or WHOLESALE, including the technical data sheet of each \u003cstrong\u003eLED\u003c/strong\u003e product.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"gtx-trans\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gtx-trans-icon\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
